{#
	One layout for every transactional email, so they read as the same product as
	the app rather than two unrelated messages. Palette and radii are the app's own
	tokens converted out of oklch, which no mail client understands:
	  --background #FFFFFF   --foreground        #09090B
	  --muted      #F4F4F5   --muted-foreground  #6F6F7A
	  --border     #E4E4E7   --primary           #18181B / #FAFAFA
	  --radius     14px on the card; the button sits tighter, at 11px (radius-md),
	               as controls do in the app.

	The look follows the app's: breathy, and the Wordmark (the gradient mark plus
	"frogQuiz") set larger than anything around it, inside the card.

	One deliberate exception to "the rainbow is spent once": the mark's gradient
	also runs as a band across the top of the card, so the email is recognisable
	at a glance in an inbox (François's call, 2026-10-04). Nothing else takes a
	color; the button stays zinc primary.

	Email constraints this has to live inside:
	  - Tables, not flex or grid. Outlook renders through Word.
	  - Every style inlined on the element. Gmail keeps inline styles and strips
	    much of <style>; the <style> block here is a progressive enhancement only.
	  - Inter loads in Apple Mail, iOS Mail and Outlook for Mac. Gmail (web and
	    Android) blocks web fonts outright, so every font-family ends in a real
	    system stack and the layout is sized to survive the substitution.
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
	<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
	<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
	<title>{{ self.subject() }}</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<!--[if mso]>
	<style>* { font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; }</style>
	<![endif]-->
	<style>
		@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
		body { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; }
		a { text-decoration: none; }
		@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
			.fq-pad { padding-left: 28px !important; padding-right: 28px !important; }
			.fq-h1 { font-size: 26px !important; }
			.fq-btn { display: block !important; text-align: center !important; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F4F4F5;">
<span style="display: none; max-height: 0; max-width: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all; visibility: hidden; color: transparent">{% block preheader %}{% endblock %}</span>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #F4F4F5; border-collapse: collapse">
	<tr>
		<td align="center" style="padding: 56px 16px">

			<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width: 520px; border-collapse: collapse">

				<!-- The card. Same white-on-muted, 1px border and 14px radius as every
				     Card in the app. -->
				<tr>
					<td style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E4E7; border-radius: 14px">
						<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse">
							<!-- The mark's gradient, edge to edge. Clients that drop gradients
							     keep its middle green. -->
							<tr>
								<td height="8" bgcolor="#6bcf7f" style="height: 8px; line-height: 8px; font-size: 0; background-color: #6bcf7f; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ffb347 20%, #ffd93d 40%, #6bcf7f 60%, #4fc3f7 80%, #9775fa 100%); border-radius: 13px 13px 0 0">&nbsp;</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="fq-pad" style="padding: 40px 44px 40px">

									<!-- The Wordmark, as in the app's navbar but larger: the mark and
									     the name. The one place the rainbow appears. -->
									<a href="{{ base_url }}" style="text-decoration: none">
										<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse">
											<tr>
												<td style="vertical-align: middle">
													<img src="{{ base_url }}/apple-touch-icon.png" width="44" height="44" alt=""
														style="display: block; width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 0; border-radius: 11px">
												</td>
												<td style="vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 12px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #09090B">frogQuiz</td>
											</tr>
										</table>
									</a>

									<h1 class="fq-h1" style="margin: 40px 0 12px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #09090B">{% block heading %}{% endblock %}</h1>

									<p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 400; color: #6F6F7A">{% block lede %}{% endblock %}</p>

									{# Optional: a short code to type by hand (the sign-in mail). Set in the app's own
									   type at display size on the muted ground, with no colour of its own. Tabular
									   figures and wide tracking keep the digits apart; the left padding is wider
									   than the right to offset the trailing space letter-spacing adds after the
									   last digit. #}
									{% set fq_code %}{% block code_block %}{% endblock %}{% endset %}
										{% if fq_code|trim %}
									<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 32px">
										<tr>
											<td align="center" bgcolor="#F4F4F5" style="background-color: #F4F4F5; border: 1px solid #E4E4E7; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 20px 22px 32px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.28em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #09090B">{{ fq_code }}</td>
										</tr>
									</table>
									{% endif %}

									<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse">
										<tr>
											<td bgcolor="#18181B" style="background-color: #18181B; border-radius: 11px">
												<a class="fq-btn" href="{% block action_url %}{% endblock %}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
													style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 24px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; color: #FAFAFA; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 11px">{% block action_label %}{% endblock %}</a>
											</td>
										</tr>
									</table>

									<!-- A hairline and the raw URL. Plenty of clients strip the anchor
									     or block the click, and then there is nothing to copy. -->
									<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse">
										<tr>
											<td style="padding: 36px 0 0">
												<div style="height: 1px; line-height: 1px; font-size: 0; background-color: #E4E4E7">&nbsp;</div>
											</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td style="padding: 20px 0 0; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6F6F7A">
												Or paste this into your browser:<br>
												<span style="word-break: break-all; color: #09090B">{{ self.action_url() }}</span>
											</td>
										</tr>
									</table>

								</td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</td>
				</tr>

				<tr>
					<td class="fq-pad" align="center" style="padding: 28px 44px 0; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6F6F7A">
						{% block footnote %}{% endblock %}
					</td>
				</tr>

			</table>

		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
